---
description: OpenPlanr portable pipeline policy
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `.planr/runtime-lock.json` before pipeline work. Portable procedures and
schemas are supplied by `planr-pipeline`; all project references are relative
to the repository root. PLAN and SHIP are separate user actions. Dispatch the nine
roles from the portable registry through Composer when supported, with sequential
fallback. Respect dependency ordering, Preserve paths, correction limits, and role
file ownership. Append producer history to `.planr/provenance.jsonl`.
